{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-08",
  "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "小核 CNN 依赖逐层扩大的感受野；浅层网络中相距很远的 patch 可能没有共同接收二者的节点。Transformer 用 attention 在 token 间混合信息。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 4
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "本讲把 token 视为一组神经元形成的向量，是模型各层访问和修改信息的基本单位。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "把图像裁成 patches，向量化后经可学习线性投影得到 d 维 tokens；N 个 token 作为 T 的 N 行。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "标量权重作用于整条 token 向量，因而左乘 W 改变 token 轴而保留代码维度。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "共享函数 F_θ 分别变换每一行，不与其他 token 通信；通常 F_θ 是 MLP。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "token net 交替执行节点混合与逐节点更新；课件把 GNN 的 AGGREGATE/UPDATE 对应到这两步，并把 Transformer 看作完全图上的 GNN。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 23
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 24
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "普通线性层的 W 是自由参数，而注意力矩阵 A 由输入数据经过函数 f 构造，因此是动态加权汇聚。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "每个输入 token 投影出 query、key、value；每个 query 与所有 keys 匹配，归一化权重随后混合 values，产生相同数量的输出 tokens。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 29
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 30
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "k 个 head 使用各自的 Q/K/V 函数并行产生表示，按 token 对齐拼接成 N×kv，再由 W_MSA 投影至 d 维。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 37
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "一个块采用 token norm→MSA→残差，再 token norm→逐 token MLP→残差；灰色块重复 L 次。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 38
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 39
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "若输入 token 行被置换，token-wise 层和 attention 的输出行随之作同一置换；组合后的 transformer 仍保持该性质。等变不是输出不变。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 35
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "为每个图像 token 编码 x、y 坐标在一组不同尺度正弦波上的取值，再把位置代码附加到 token 表示；第44页正文给出的方式是拼接，从而使位置可区分。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 43
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 44
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "causal mask 令某位置只能依赖允许的过去位置；同一次矩阵计算可监督多个 next-token 目标，多层连接仍保持因果路径。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 48
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 51
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 52
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "在图像到文本架构中，文本 token 发出 queries，图像 tokens 提供 keys/values；文本解码器本身同时使用 causal self-attention。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 54
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
